Come and grab a bargain at the **Dartington Table Top Sale** - clothes, shoes, baby and kids items, toys, household goods, books and so much more, both pre-loved and new.

Enjoy hot drinks and home-baked cakes at our **cafe stall**, plus goodies donated by **Luna's Bakehouse** and **Designs Cafe**. Everything the cafe raises goes to the DRA's [Dartington Pool fund](/facilities/pool).

